# @agent-k/tools

You are in the **tools** domain (registry, executors, tool backends).

## Allowed
- Tool definitions, registry, executors, patch/search/indexing backends used by tools
- Shared normalize/diff helpers that used to leak from chat (keep them here, not in UI)

## Forbidden
- Importing `src/chat/**` (webview helpers). If needed, move the helper into tools or a tiny shared module first.
- Implementing LLM HTTP clients (that is `providers`)
- Chat layout / React components

## Dependency direction
`tools → core/types` only. Not `tools → chat-ui`. Not `tools → providers` implementations.
